OL,3,ABanks say Healey planning to increase
OL,4,Atax on their profits in Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey is planning to
OL,7,Fincrease taxes on the bank sector,
OL,8,Fsenior banking executives have told the
OL,9,FBBC.
OL,11,FHealey has described banks as part of
OL,12,F"the crown jewels" of the UK economy,
OL,13,Fbut leaders in the sector have said it
OL,14,Fwill be "on the menu" at the Budget in
OL,15,Ftwo weeks' time.
OL,17,FThe biggest four banks collectively
OL,18,Fmade about #15bn profit in the first
OL,19,Fsix months of this year, and trade
OL,20,Funions have called for them to face
OL,21,Fadditional taxes.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
