OL,3,ABanks say Healey planning to increase
OL,4,Atax on their profits in Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trade body for the banking sector,
OL,7,FUK Finance, warned "further increases
OL,8,Fin bank taxes would weaken
OL,9,Fcompetitiveness, discourage investment
OL,10,Fand job creation, and work against the
OL,11,Fgovernment's ambition to deliver growth
OL,12,Fin every postcode".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
