OL,3,AReform faces questions over candidate
OL,4,Avetting after undercover filming
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK is facing further questions
OL,7,Fabout its vetting procedures for
OL,8,Fcandidates, after undercover filming
OL,9,Fbroadcast by ITV News.
OL,11,FIn the film, gathered over the course
OL,12,Fof a year, an undercover reporter is
OL,13,Fadvised by a local party chairman to
OL,14,Fdelete social media posts supportive of
OL,15,Ffar-right activist Tommy Robinson,
OL,16,Fbefore being encouraged to apply to
OL,17,Fstand to be a councillor for the party.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
