OL,3,ATrump calls off livestream of Fort Hood
OL,4,Aattacker's execution by firing squad
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has called
OL,7,Foff plans to livestream the execution
OL,8,Fof former US army psychiatrist Nidal
OL,9,FHasan by firing squad.
OL,11,FTrump had previously said he approved
OL,12,Fof showing the death of the Fort Hood
OL,13,Fattacker, while Vice-President JD Vance
OL,14,Fcast doubt on whether it would happen
OL,15,Fand said he would not watch it.
OL,17,FTrump's decision to cancel the
OL,18,Flivestream came after widespread
OL,19,Fcriticism in the US and globally. On
OL,20,FThursday, he said that "many very good
OL,21,Fand well meaning people would rather
OL,22,Fnot watch him die".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
